    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Hordes of the Dead</i> is a third-person survival horror game where you\u2019ll explore devastated areas, search for a safe place, and face relentless hordes of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your stamina, find resources, and survive slow but deadly zombies. They won\u2019t stop until they tear you apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Tense and visceral third-person combat<br>\u25cf Cinematic bite and death animations<br>\u25cf A dark atmosphere  designed for maximum tension<br>\u25cf Mission and exploration system to progress through different areas<br>\u25cf Detailed gore and brutal encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The apocalypse has no explanation. No one is coming to save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you find a safe place... or will you become part of the Horde?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Hordes of the Dead</i> is a third-person survival horror game where you\u2019ll explore devastated areas, search for a safe place, and face relentless hordes of zombies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your stamina, find resources, and survive slow but deadly zombies. They won\u2019t stop until they tear you apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Tense and visceral third-person combat<br>\u25cf Cinematic bite and death animations<br>\u25cf A dark atmosphere  designed for maximum tension<br>\u25cf Mission and exploration system to progress through different areas<br>\u25cf Detailed gore and brutal encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The apocalypse has no explanation. No one is coming to save you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you find a safe place... or will you become part of the Horde?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
